###register a new cliente
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678",
  "nombre": "John",
  "apellido": "Doe",
  "correo": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "confirm": "password123",
  "fecha_nacimiento": "1990-01-01",
  "genero": "M",
  "id_obra_social": 1
}

